		</span></i> : generally, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fond
			of</i> a thing, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς χρυσίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Dem.</u>
					25
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ τοῦ σώματος -ικὰ πρὸς
				πλησμονὴν καὶ κένωσιν</span> the <i>cravings</i> of the
			body, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				186c
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς, περιαλγήσας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					6.54
				</span></i>
